<main class="home">
    <section class="home-hero">
        <h1><span>Tell Claude once.</span> <span><em>Parachute</em> remembers.</span></h1>
        <div class="say">
            <p class="lede">A vault of your own that Claude reads and writes: your notes, tasks, people, the books you're reading. It's there in every chat, Claude builds live pages over it, and it's yours to take anywhere. ChatGPT and any MCP app connect the same way.</p>
            <p class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/docs/use/start/">Start free on Parachute Cloud</a> <a class="link-arrow" href="/docs/run/self-host/">Or run your own</a></p>
            <section class="keep" aria-labelledby="yours">
                <h2 id="yours">Yours to keep</h2>
                <p>Open source (AGPL). The same vault engine runs on Parachute Cloud and on your own machine, and a vault moves between them as a folder of plain markdown. Your AI works for you on your records; nothing runs that you didn't allow.</p>
            </section>
        </div>
        {# The card hangs from the canopy: the drawing's rigging ends at the card's top edge. #}
        <div class="hangs">
            {% include "canopy.svg" %}
            <aside class="connect-card" aria-labelledby="connect">
                <h2 id="connect">Connect Claude</h2>
                <ol class="steps">
                    <li>Sign up at <a href="https://my.parachute.computer">my.parachute.computer</a> and name your vault.</li>
                    <li>In Claude, <b>+ › Plugins › Manage plugins › Add › Add custom connector</b>, and paste:</li>
                </ol>
                <div class="addr"><code>https://my.parachute.computer/<wbr>mcp</code></div>
                <ol class="steps" start="3">
                    <li>Sign in, allow it at <b>Read &amp; write</b>, and ask:</li>
                </ol>
                <ol class="asks">
                    <li>Remember this: the seed library box goes by the garden gate.</li>
                    <li>Make me a live board of my open tasks that I can tick off.</li>
                    <li>What did I tell you about the garden this month?</li>
                </ol>
                <p class="more"><a class="link-arrow" href="/docs/use/connect-your-ai/">Step by step, with pictures</a></p>
            </aside>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-band seen" aria-labelledby="seen">
        <h2 id="seen" class="band-title">What Claude does with it</h2>
        <p class="band-note">From claude.ai, on a test vault of made-up records.</p>
        <div class="seen-grid">
            <figure class="seen-wide">
                <img src="/assets/shots/claude-live-board.webp" width="1100" height="509" loading="lazy" alt="claude.ai: asked for a live board of open tasks, Claude built one beside the chat, tasks grouped by project, each with a circle to tick">
