            <figure>
                <img src="/assets/shots/claude-capture.webp" width="780" height="330" loading="lazy" alt="claude.ai: 'Jot this down in Parachute test: a seed library box at the garden gate…', and Claude's answer: two records added, a note and a task, linked to Maya">
                <figcaption><b>It remembers.</b> Say it once; Claude files a note and a task, linked to the people in them. Any later chat finds it.</figcaption>
